  m_text: 'Welcome!

    I''m curious, did you visit the tree in front of the Union
    before me?

    Or did you already know I was here?


    Here''s a riddle for
    you: Three of these

    buildings are, as of 2025, not part of the Main Quad.


    Two
    of them still exist, however. The one that doesn''t

    is the next step in
    your journey.'
